VioletCity_Interior5_Text_OldWoman::
	.string "When you first catch a POKéMON,\n"
	.string "it may be weak.\p"
	.string "But it will eventually grow to be\n"
	.string "strong.\p"
	.string "It’s important to treat POKéMON with\n"
	.string "love.$"

VioletCity_Interior5_Text_Youngster::
	.string "POKéMON can hold items like POTION\n"
	.string "and ANTIDOTE.\p"
	.string "But they don’t appear to know how\n"
	.string "to use manmade items.$"

VioletCity_Interior5_Text_Youngster2::
	.string "Those BIKERS were about to trash\n"
	.string "this POKéMON MART.\p"
	.string "Am I glad they decided to leave!$"
